      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Value for money: The micro inverter technology is a little bit more expensive however you get the benefits of new technology.  I can check daily on my iphone (via an app) how much power my solar panels are generating (both in historical or real time). Micro converter technology is also very flexible to expand as it only requires purchasing of additional panels as each panel has it's own inverter.Quality of system:  A+++  High quality.Installation: A+++ Very professional.  No messy wires, very tidy.  The guys were punctual, installed panels, hooked system up, explained internet monitoring of panels, cleaned up and were gone before 2.30pm.Customer Service:  A+++ Gino was very polite, frank and honest in the advice her provided. It was a pleasure to conduct business with him and Aussie Made Solar.I highly, highly, highly recommend AUSSIE MADE SOLAR for all you solar panel installation needs!!!!!!",
