      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The guys at Aussie Made Solar gave me a no-bull assessment on my circumstances,  only quoting me for the system I needed and not the one that would earn them the most money.Knowing that they used Australian Made products played a large part in my decision to go with them, and I haven't had any reason to regret my choice.With their online monitoring system, they routinely monitor the performance of their panels and micro inverters, and will call me without prompting to rectify the situation.As my experience with the feed-in system had been so good, I did not hesitate to contact them when I was ready to take the next step and install an off-grid system with battery backup.Both times the installation was efficient and hassle free, with Benson and Gino turning up when they said they would, and finishing within their planned timeframe.I have already, and will continue to recommend Aussie Made Solar to anyone who is looking at making the commitment to clean energy.",
